This is an original automation script. It builds and serves a Caddy-based Markdown
server, using the following third-party open-source software, each under its own
license (all credit to their respective authors):

  Caddy                   Apache-2.0   https://github.com/caddyserver/caddy
  goldmark                MIT          https://github.com/yuin/goldmark
  caddy-webdav            Apache-2.0   https://github.com/mholt/caddy-webdav
  xcaddy (build tool)     Apache-2.0   https://github.com/caddyserver/xcaddy
  Docker / Moby           Apache-2.0   https://github.com/moby/moby

Optional integration: Authentik forward-auth (https://goauthentik.io/, MIT) when
the server is placed behind that identity provider.

The `save`/`push` modes redistribute a custom-built Caddy image (Caddy core +
caddy-webdav module, both Apache-2.0). Retain their copyright/license notices and
any bundled NOTICE files.
